---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — CleanerBath"
  description="Terms of service for using CleanerBath.co.uk — the cleaner-matching service for Bath."
>
  <header class="border-b border-sage-100 bg-cream-50">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 sm:px-8 py-5">
      <a href="/" class="text-sage-700 text-sm hover:underline">← Back to CleanerBath</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 sm:px-8 py-16">
    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-sage-700 font-semibold">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-700/70">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-GB', { day: 'numeric', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' })}</p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-bold">1. What CleanerBath does</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">
      CleanerBath is a <strong>matching service</strong>. We collect details about the cleaning work you need,
      identify a Bath-based cleaner we work with who can take it on, and pass your details to them so they can contact you with a quote.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">
      <strong>CleanerBath does not provide cleaning services.</strong> Any cleaning work is provided by the independent cleaner
      we match you with, under a separate contract between you and them.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">2. No charge to you</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">
      There is no charge to you for using CleanerBath. Our matching service is paid for by the cleaner, not by you.
      You agree any cleaning work, and any price for it, directly with the cleaner we match you with.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">3. Service area</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">
      CleanerBath operates in <strong>Bath city centre and immediate suburbs</strong> (BA1, BA2 and parts of neighbouring postcodes).
      We may decline to forward enquiries from outside this area.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">4. Your responsibilities</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">When using this website you agree to:</p>
    <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-ink-700/85">
      <li>• Provide accurate information in the enquiry form</li>
      <li>• Submit only genuine enquiries — not test, spam, or fraudulent submissions</li>
      <li>• Not use the service to harass, threaten, or abuse any cleaner we put you in touch with</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">5. The cleaner's terms</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">
      Once we introduce you, the cleaner is responsible for delivering the cleaning work. Their pricing, terms, cancellation policy,
      insurance, and any complaints are matters between you and them. CleanerBath does not act as agent for the cleaner and does not
      warrant the quality of their work.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">
      If something goes wrong with the cleaning, please raise it with the cleaner first. If you can't resolve it,
      contact us and we'll do what we can to help.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">6. Liability</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">
      We take care to match you with a vetted Bath cleaner, but we cannot guarantee the outcome of any cleaning work.
      To the maximum extent permitted by law, our liability to you is limited to the amount we have received from the matched cleaner for the introduction.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">7. Intellectual property</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">
      The CleanerBath name, logo, and website content are owned by us. You may not copy or reproduce them without permission.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">8. Changes</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">
      We may update these terms occasionally. The "last updated" date at the top will always show the current version.
      Continuing to use the site after changes counts as acceptance.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">9. Governing law</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">
      These terms are governed by the law of England and Wales. Any disputes are subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the English courts.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">10. Contact</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">
      Questions about these terms? Use the contact form on our home page.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>